  ('s-mehndi-occasions', 'mehndi-for-occasions', 'Mehndi for Occasions', 'Art & Craft', 'MO', 'Traditional and contemporary mehndi for festivals, parties and celebrations.', 'Quick, elegant designs for festivals, sangeet and family functions.', 500, '1–3 hours', 3),
